1. SYSTEM OVERVIEW
================================================================================

The Character System is the foundation of the Still Waters simulation. 
It manages all character data, lifecycle events, and provides a clean 
API for other systems to interact with characters.

PURPOSE:
- Centralize all character data management
- Provide consistent read/write operations
- Handle lifecycle events (birth, aging, death, inheritance)
- Enable UI rendering with clean separation

KEY PRINCIPLES:
- Single Source of Truth (character-state.js)
- Command-Query Separation (commands vs queries)
- Separation of Concerns (state, commands, queries, lifecycle, UI)
- Recursion Guards on all public functions
- Change Notifications via subscriptions
- No direct masterData access outside state

